WEBVTT

00:01.819 --> 00:03.779
- Filling with hot water.
- Filling with hot water.

00:04.071 --> 00:05.322
Don't mimic it.

00:06.448 --> 00:07.199
Your parents?

00:07.449 --> 00:08.367
At work.

00:08.367 --> 00:11.136
But it's snowing,
so they might come home earlier.

00:11.286 --> 00:12.246
Isn't that bad?!

00:14.164 --> 00:15.874
What's bad about it?

00:17.851 --> 00:19.895
How did things turn out like this?

00:22.631 --> 00:24.299
Wipe it dry yourself!

00:24.925 --> 00:26.885
I didn't even as you to.

00:29.429 --> 00:31.306
Your bath is ready.

00:31.723 --> 00:33.784
Feel free to use the shampoo.

00:33.909 --> 00:35.369
M-Mmkay.

00:37.271 --> 00:38.522
Calm down...

00:38.939 --> 00:41.650
Don't make this gross... Be cool...

00:42.359 --> 00:43.777
Huh? Wait!

00:44.069 --> 00:45.821
Being fully naked at Yamada's house?

00:46.029 --> 00:48.029
Also, why did I just waltz into the bath?!

00:48.029 --> 00:49.383
How's the water?

00:49.658 --> 00:51.451
I-I haven't entered the bath.

00:57.958 --> 01:00.210
Y-Yamada's smell...

01:00.836 --> 01:02.629
...is all over...

01:04.841 --> 01:07.885
S-Shampoo...

01:11.830 --> 01:14.892
Stop it! Don't unconsciously
look for stuff she left around!

01:15.392 --> 01:18.187
This place is dangerous.
I shouldn't stay here for too long.

01:20.647 --> 01:21.690
Ichikawa.

01:22.691 --> 01:23.567
W-What is it?

01:24.067 --> 01:26.067
I'll leave you a change of clothes.

01:28.322 --> 01:29.531
I'll put your uniform

01:29.907 --> 01:31.658
in the bag...

01:32.092 --> 01:34.119
S-Sorry for the trouble.

01:42.211 --> 01:45.005
I was touching it...
while I was talking to her.

03:16.138 --> 03:18.265
T-Think about this carefully!

03:18.765 --> 03:22.853
Yamada is feeling responsible
for my injury and that keychain!

03:24.896 --> 03:28.356
I should be more considerate
about Yamada's feelings..

03:30.210 --> 03:32.210
(Yamada)

03:32.654 --> 03:36.700
Normally, you'd lend a male
family member's clothing in this case...

03:37.467 --> 03:38.051
Huh?

03:38.493 --> 03:40.037
Wait... huh?

03:40.620 --> 03:42.497
Huh? W-Wait...

03:44.791 --> 03:47.336
My undewear's... not here!

03:48.211 --> 03:51.423
She put it inside the bag
along with my uniform?!

03:52.215 --> 03:56.136
I should wear this for now,
retrieve my underwear and go to the toilet...

03:56.386 --> 03:59.973
Wait... I'm going to
wear this... directly?

04:00.223 --> 04:01.224
This?

04:03.018 --> 04:05.103
I'll wash it before returning it, anyway.

04:05.437 --> 04:06.813
Just for a split second.

04:07.606 --> 04:10.776
Huh? I-I forgot about him!

04:11.960 --> 04:13.195
Oh, you're done!

04:14.446 --> 04:17.866
Hey, which one's better,
chicken paitan or shio chanko?

04:17.924 --> 04:19.176
Loungewear only!

04:19.551 --> 04:20.802
W-What is this about?

04:20.802 --> 04:22.871
Why are you asking? It's for the hot pot!

04:23.246 --> 04:25.791
I've got a hot pot set,
so you just have to put it in.

04:26.016 --> 04:29.378
All of a sudden, we're eating lunch.

04:30.253 --> 04:31.296
T-Then...

04:32.923 --> 04:34.549
Don't think of anything weird!

04:34.925 --> 04:35.884
It's no use...

04:37.928 --> 04:40.055
A bloody ocean surrounds me...

04:40.055 --> 04:42.157
- Somebody...
- If I let my guard down...

04:42.391 --> 04:43.350
It'll all be over...

04:45.685 --> 04:46.978
Right! My underwear!

04:47.479 --> 04:48.413
Where is...

04:48.480 --> 04:50.757
Huh? Ack!

04:50.757 --> 04:52.334
I-I-I'm gonna die!

04:52.709 --> 04:53.919
I'm gonna die!

04:54.319 --> 04:54.986
I'm gonna...

04:58.740 --> 05:01.201
Stay! Stay, stay!

05:01.201 --> 05:02.994
Down! Down!

05:04.413 --> 05:05.330
Alright.

05:06.373 --> 05:07.249
Ah! I'm sorry!

05:10.419 --> 05:11.336
It's fine...

05:15.841 --> 05:17.300
Gear equipped.

05:17.551 --> 05:18.844
That could've been awful.

05:20.846 --> 05:22.322
W-Why did you change clothes?

05:22.431 --> 05:24.099
I got this from Moeko.

05:24.516 --> 05:26.952
I thought this one's cuter!

05:32.149 --> 05:33.775
Huuuh?!

05:35.026 --> 05:36.445
Why don't you sit?

05:42.826 --> 05:46.471
I eat a hot pot before dinner
whenever my mom comes home late.

05:46.471 --> 05:47.430
On my own.

05:47.430 --> 05:48.498
Before dinner?!

05:48.832 --> 05:50.141
Awesome, right?

05:50.584 --> 05:53.003
A solo hot pot.
It's like something only adults do.

05:53.103 --> 05:56.131
You're not an adult, you're just lonely.

05:58.592 --> 05:59.426
Then...

05:59.968 --> 06:01.761
Will you eat with me once in a while?

06:04.639 --> 06:06.475
W-What did you bring here?

06:07.243 --> 06:08.351
Hmm?

06:08.768 --> 06:09.936
You're curious?

06:10.187 --> 06:10.979
Not really.

06:11.730 --> 06:12.355
Nope!

06:12.772 --> 06:13.648
(Bond)
You're going to look!

06:15.192 --> 06:16.193
An album, huh?

06:16.526 --> 06:20.255
Looking at Yamada's yearbook this soon?

06:21.114 --> 06:22.257
(Anna Yamada)
Here.

06:22.257 --> 06:24.092
That's you, Yamada.

06:24.201 --> 06:25.368
What do you mean by that?

06:25.577 --> 06:26.953
That's mostly her already.

06:27.829 --> 06:29.372
Is this a school trip?

06:29.539 --> 06:30.790
Yeah! To Nikko.

06:31.458 --> 06:33.376
You're always eating something.

06:34.461 --> 06:35.504
Oh, this...

06:35.754 --> 06:37.380
You always spot me first.

06:42.010 --> 06:43.386
You play the piano?

06:44.179 --> 06:46.431
I learned a bit of it a long time ago.

06:47.557 --> 06:48.767
For about a year.

06:49.100 --> 06:50.018
I see.

06:50.310 --> 06:51.895
Other than that, ballet.

06:52.187 --> 06:53.063
English.

06:53.396 --> 06:55.396
Also, swimming and kendo.

06:55.774 --> 06:57.984
I quit them all right away, though.

06:58.401 --> 06:59.444
Really?

07:05.158 --> 07:07.035
I got the chance to
do a lot of things, but...

07:08.453 --> 07:11.706
I couldn't be better than
everyone else no matter what I did.

07:13.458 --> 07:16.419
I don't like that someone who
started after me surpassed me.

07:17.420 --> 07:20.507
They felt bad for me and let me quit.

07:21.841 --> 07:23.652
Whenever I quit,

07:23.760 --> 07:26.680
they would always
make me my favorite foods.

07:27.889 --> 07:29.516
When I didn't
get into private school, too,

07:29.808 --> 07:31.309
and when I hurt my nose.

07:32.202 --> 07:33.201
Great parents.

07:33.562 --> 07:34.312
Yeah.

07:35.105 --> 07:37.190
But lately...

07:37.774 --> 07:38.567
I'm scared.

07:40.860 --> 07:43.530
The people around me adore me too much...

07:44.489 --> 07:45.407
That maybe actually

07:45.865 --> 07:49.077
I'm causing them a lot of trouble,
but I don't realize it.

07:50.161 --> 07:51.079
And if that goes on...

07:51.997 --> 07:53.164
One day,

07:53.623 --> 07:55.417
one day, the people dear to me will also

07:55.792 --> 07:57.669
hate me, maybe.

07:59.087 --> 08:00.046
Yamada...

08:02.649 --> 08:03.817
I cried too much.

08:06.428 --> 08:08.847
I don't know about your parents, but...

08:09.431 --> 08:11.016
I can call out trouble

08:11.558 --> 08:13.476
and stuff that I don't like, I think.

08:14.853 --> 08:16.813
With you, I can be honest.

08:17.689 --> 08:19.399
I've said this before too, but...

08:19.482 --> 08:20.150
Hey.

08:20.859 --> 08:23.486
Can I ask you something
that's always been bothering me?

08:25.113 --> 08:26.239
Before winter break...

08:26.656 --> 08:30.327
There were two days when you
didn't come to the library, right?

08:32.454 --> 08:34.039
You said you had something to do.

08:34.497 --> 08:35.832
Is that really true?

08:39.294 --> 08:43.131
You said you're the type who
can call out things you don't like,

08:44.424 --> 08:45.634
but I don't think you are.

08:47.344 --> 08:48.678
I mean, you...

08:49.429 --> 08:51.890
I know how nice you are, Ichikawa.

08:52.557 --> 08:54.100
That's why I'm scared.

08:58.396 --> 09:01.191
I'm sorry. I'm a pain to deal with, huh?

09:05.070 --> 09:06.154
Huh?

09:15.038 --> 09:16.331
I'm sorry for lying to you.

09:17.832 --> 09:18.708
That was...

09:19.376 --> 09:20.960
...because I'm too weak.

09:21.836 --> 09:24.089
I just didn't... want to hurt you.

09:24.589 --> 09:26.966
So I hid myself in my shell.

09:28.051 --> 09:30.345
She was just scared that I would hate her.

09:34.307 --> 09:35.266
That's right.

09:36.017 --> 09:36.976
We...

09:37.602 --> 09:38.561
...are alike.

09:41.439 --> 09:43.733
Chinese cabbage tastes
the best when it's all wilted!

09:43.733 --> 09:45.443
Don't serve it just like that!

09:45.443 --> 09:46.111
Here.

09:47.171 --> 09:50.990
But you know, I've always been a mess.

09:51.783 --> 09:54.786
Why am I only getting
anxious about it now?

09:58.289 --> 09:59.499
Could this be...

10:00.875 --> 10:01.751
Maybe...

10:02.961 --> 10:04.170
Because I...

10:07.382 --> 10:09.259
Isn't it because you've grown up?

10:10.218 --> 10:11.803
Being a grownup is a pain.

10:14.639 --> 10:16.057
I guess you're right.

10:16.891 --> 10:18.476
Being concerned about it is good.

10:19.102 --> 10:21.980
Whenever you quit your lessons,

10:22.105 --> 10:24.232
you parents always made you good food.

10:24.858 --> 10:27.652
That's because they don't want you
to stop trying new things.

10:28.921 --> 10:32.782
They know that you
can keep moving forward.

10:35.577 --> 10:36.286
Yeah.

10:38.329 --> 10:40.540
My messages have piled up...

10:40.832 --> 10:42.292
- Huh?!
- What's wrong?!

10:42.292 --> 10:45.144
My mom is already at
the convenience store nearby...

10:45.420 --> 10:46.437
12 minutes ago!

10:47.380 --> 10:50.108
I-It'll be fine!
My friends come over all the time!

10:50.108 --> 10:51.785
But what about male friends?!

10:51.785 --> 10:53.428
That's... never happened, but...

10:54.179 --> 10:57.182
T-Then... I'm dressed up like this, so...

10:57.640 --> 10:59.809
If I'm going to meet her, it'll have
to be when I'm dressed properly.

11:00.185 --> 11:02.228
I see... Then...

11:02.562 --> 11:04.272
When you're dressed properly,

11:04.814 --> 11:05.690
one day...

11:06.208 --> 11:07.500
Hurry!

11:07.500 --> 11:08.276
Hey!

11:13.823 --> 11:14.908
Welcome back!

11:15.700 --> 11:17.202
You've got a friend over?

11:17.577 --> 11:18.411
Yeah.

11:18.679 --> 11:19.613
Chi's here.

11:19.913 --> 11:20.830
I see.

11:21.206 --> 11:23.875
Oh, you've filled up the bath?

11:24.101 --> 11:25.494
You're so thoughtful.

11:25.668 --> 11:29.005
- Oh, right! Just filled it up.
- Okay! While her mom's in the bath...

11:30.673 --> 11:31.925
This is Yamada's room...

11:32.550 --> 11:34.052
Yamada's bed...

11:34.761 --> 11:37.722
Wait, this is not the time
to be thinking about that!

11:38.890 --> 11:41.434
I made Yamada have to lie...

11:41.935 --> 11:43.186
If I'm found out, because of me,

11:43.520 --> 11:45.188
a crack could form in their family.

11:45.396 --> 11:47.206
Oh, you ate hot pot?

11:47.206 --> 11:49.292
Yeah! I made it myself.

11:49.292 --> 11:52.654
I see. By the way,
you're wearing something cute today.

11:52.862 --> 11:55.757
Yeah! M-Moeko gave it to me.

11:55.757 --> 11:58.259
It's a bit cold, so I thought I'd wear it.

12:01.412 --> 12:03.923
I've also got something similar,
so maybe I should wear it!

12:03.923 --> 12:07.085
M-More importantly,
you should warm up now!

12:14.676 --> 12:17.362
Not the time!
My dad's also coming home soon!

12:17.362 --> 12:18.805
What?! Your dad?

12:19.848 --> 12:22.225
W-What kind of...

12:23.643 --> 12:25.895
He's... like me, I guess...

12:26.729 --> 12:27.772
He's like you?

12:28.523 --> 12:29.315
Like Yamada?

12:29.315 --> 12:30.733
(So good)
So good!

12:32.944 --> 12:33.920
Down here!

12:34.053 --> 12:35.154
Anna!

12:35.406 --> 12:37.340
W-What's wrong?

12:37.340 --> 12:39.050
Is Chi okay after that hot pot?

12:39.050 --> 12:40.593
No allergies?

12:40.593 --> 12:43.262
A-Anna ate most of it.

12:43.705 --> 12:45.540
S-Sorry for coming in.

12:46.124 --> 12:47.083
Are you okay?

12:47.417 --> 12:48.310
Yes...

12:48.501 --> 12:50.128
That's good if that's the case.

12:50.503 --> 12:52.503
Seems like it'll continue to snow,

12:52.589 --> 12:54.424
so don't go home too late, okay?

12:59.387 --> 13:00.388
Sorry...

13:02.682 --> 13:03.766
Me too.

13:05.602 --> 13:06.769
I made you have to lie.

13:07.395 --> 13:08.187
Sorry.

13:26.347 --> 13:28.499
P-Payback for last time.

13:31.603 --> 13:33.713
I-It's fine, I don't mind.

13:34.547 --> 13:37.091
It's my first time keeping
a secret from my mom, but...

13:37.926 --> 13:41.012
I'm an adult now anyway... so.

13:42.138 --> 13:44.782
Even though you still use your name
when talking to your parents?

13:46.034 --> 13:47.894
K-Keep that part between us!

13:51.814 --> 13:52.690
Bye bye!

13:54.859 --> 13:57.195
I made a lot of secrets today...

14:09.474 --> 14:11.310
A-A titan!

14:12.978 --> 14:14.978
(Yamada)

14:15.588 --> 14:17.966
High-rise apartments are terrifying!

14:20.176 --> 14:21.511
I'm never coming back here!

14:23.972 --> 14:25.740
(What a mess, sorry)
(Come again sometime) (Okay?)

14:25.740 --> 14:27.976
(Kay)

14:33.064 --> 14:35.625
If I use the washing machine,

14:35.625 --> 14:38.669
people will find out,
so I have to hand wash it...

14:39.570 --> 14:40.797
Wait.

14:40.905 --> 14:42.949
If I use a different detergent
with what Yamada uses,

14:43.282 --> 14:45.076
it might cause trouble later...

14:45.785 --> 14:48.579
I'll stop for now and ask Yamada first.

14:53.793 --> 14:55.520
Crap! You were here?

14:55.520 --> 14:58.548
Ugh, Kyo, you pervert!

15:00.425 --> 15:02.425
Is it that different?

15:02.510 --> 15:04.721
It's washed at someone else's house,
so of course...

15:11.853 --> 15:12.870
I can't smell anything.

15:14.856 --> 15:17.542
I only washed it and returned it,

15:17.817 --> 15:18.943
but that took a lot...

15:20.445 --> 15:22.196
You can do it, Kyotaro!

15:22.822 --> 15:23.614
Do what?

15:24.032 --> 15:27.076
It's about Yamada!
You should think about things more deeply!

15:27.368 --> 15:29.203
Bath, hot pot, hug...

15:29.787 --> 15:32.206
There's only one explanation
why she did all of this.

15:33.433 --> 15:34.809
No, you've got it wrong.

15:35.334 --> 15:37.334
Had I not said no,

15:37.628 --> 15:39.589
Yamada would've had me meet her parents.

15:40.173 --> 15:41.799
There are no special feelings behind it.

15:42.133 --> 15:43.801
She just treats me like a friend.

15:44.302 --> 15:45.720
Treat you like a friend?

15:46.179 --> 15:47.263
Like that?

15:47.555 --> 15:48.806
Besides...

15:49.140 --> 15:51.140
I don't even know if we are even friends.

15:51.434 --> 15:52.185
Me too.

15:57.899 --> 15:59.275
My cast got taken off.

16:00.651 --> 16:03.696
But my voice is kinda weird.

16:08.493 --> 16:09.494
Oh.

16:10.495 --> 16:12.580
Oh, your cast got taken off!

16:13.039 --> 16:15.039
I noticed it first!

16:15.416 --> 16:16.601
Listen.

16:16.601 --> 16:19.937
Yamada ate six onigiris yesterday.

16:19.937 --> 16:22.173
I ate five yesterday!
Six was the day before.

16:22.507 --> 16:24.217
What a meaningless correction.

16:24.467 --> 16:25.802
That's great.

16:27.386 --> 16:30.973
Ichikawa, you're always like that.
It makes me feel safe!

16:30.973 --> 16:33.034
Yeah, that's exactly why Ichikawa is...

16:33.034 --> 16:35.269
Is your arm okay already?

16:35.895 --> 16:37.480
I can't lift heavy things yet.

16:38.189 --> 16:40.958
My right arm is thinner.

16:44.737 --> 16:45.780
Ichikawa?

16:58.584 --> 17:00.086
It really is weird.

17:05.466 --> 17:07.151
(You don't have to talk at school)
(Just) (Meet my eyes)

17:07.151 --> 17:11.013
No, it's not that I don't want to talk...

17:16.561 --> 17:18.561
(Martial Arts Room)

17:18.561 --> 17:20.314
Huh? Where's Adachi?

17:20.565 --> 17:22.441
He's doing dance instead.

17:23.860 --> 17:25.778
I'm bad at dancing, so...

17:25.945 --> 17:27.822
I'm glad you're here, Hara.

17:28.030 --> 17:29.240
Me too.

17:32.618 --> 17:34.829
I think my gear stinks.

17:36.831 --> 17:39.392
It's the school's gear,
so it's gotta be a bit...

17:40.710 --> 17:42.044
Is it that bad?!

17:44.422 --> 17:45.423
No way...

17:46.174 --> 17:47.984
Should I offer to swap gears?

17:48.092 --> 17:49.635
I guess that's also gross...

17:50.303 --> 17:52.263
We're doing hand-to-hand practice!

17:52.555 --> 17:53.848
Pair up with someone!

17:53.949 --> 17:55.231
I'm the odd man out...

17:55.683 --> 17:56.851
As I would expect.

17:58.311 --> 18:00.246
I, uh...

18:00.246 --> 18:01.063
This is...

18:01.439 --> 18:02.523
Could it be...

18:03.774 --> 18:04.792
Watch.

18:04.901 --> 18:07.069
This is an ouchi gari!

18:09.155 --> 18:10.615
You took it well.

18:11.240 --> 18:12.366
Now, begin!

18:13.201 --> 18:16.037
Ooh! Hara looks so strong!

18:16.787 --> 18:17.872
- It'll be fine.
- L-Like this...

18:18.873 --> 18:19.999
That's right.

18:24.462 --> 18:25.722
What is it, huh?

18:25.722 --> 18:28.925
Is this how she treats her friends?

18:31.469 --> 18:32.762
But...

18:33.137 --> 18:35.489
I... stink, so...

18:36.140 --> 18:38.075
M-My gear, I mean!

18:41.562 --> 18:44.482
Is that why you don't want
to pair up with people?

18:50.655 --> 18:51.864
Payback.

19:04.460 --> 19:07.088
Are you close with Yamada, Ichikawa?

19:07.380 --> 19:08.898
Uh, that's...

19:09.298 --> 19:11.425
How do I put it... her smell...

19:14.095 --> 19:14.971
They're nice, right?

19:15.179 --> 19:16.180
Stinky girls.

19:16.472 --> 19:17.556
No, I mean...

19:19.183 --> 19:21.811
This might be my voice changing...

19:22.520 --> 19:24.313
I said all that,

19:24.730 --> 19:26.899
but I'm scared of growing up.

19:28.484 --> 19:29.568
Once I grow up,

19:30.236 --> 19:32.822
my relationship with
Yamada will definitely change.

19:33.698 --> 19:34.448
Right now,

19:34.991 --> 19:39.412
if Yamada is treating me like
how she treats her female friends,

19:39.596 --> 19:40.639
it'll be even worse.

19:43.040 --> 19:44.000
Ichikawa.

19:46.002 --> 19:47.420
But this...

19:48.045 --> 19:49.547
Trying to avoid this...

19:50.381 --> 19:51.590
I don't think that's possible.

19:53.259 --> 19:54.760
(Library)

19:55.261 --> 19:57.261
It's hard to talk.

19:57.638 --> 20:00.433
The further I chase it,
the more it runs away.

20:01.809 --> 20:03.294
Do you have a cold?

20:03.394 --> 20:04.186
No...

20:05.438 --> 20:07.565
You walked out in the snow, so...

20:07.815 --> 20:10.359
No, it's not a cold.

20:11.986 --> 20:12.903
I think...

20:13.487 --> 20:16.115
My voice... is changing.

20:17.283 --> 20:18.492
Your voice is changing?

20:22.747 --> 20:23.956
That's great!

20:24.498 --> 20:26.000
That's amazing!

20:27.585 --> 20:28.711
What's good about it?

20:29.211 --> 20:30.171
I mean,

20:30.171 --> 20:32.815
voice changing, and beard growing...

20:32.815 --> 20:35.051
That's an easily recognizable
proof that you've grown up!

20:35.051 --> 20:36.635
I don't like that.

20:36.719 --> 20:38.320
Time for celebrations!

20:38.320 --> 20:39.263
It's not!

20:40.097 --> 20:41.015
Your arm!

20:43.434 --> 20:46.771
It's not that this arm got thinner,

20:47.229 --> 20:49.357
but this one just got thicker.

20:53.652 --> 20:57.114
Proof of a grown-up...
that I'm not aware of.

20:57.323 --> 20:58.783
(\"I...\")

20:59.492 --> 21:01.035
I'm excited.

21:01.035 --> 21:03.037
(\"...Have Started to Grow Up\")

21:03.537 --> 21:06.374
Yamada always notices things for me.

21:07.208 --> 21:10.503
Ichikawa, once your voice
has gotten deeper...

21:12.880 --> 21:15.841
Call my name a lot... okay?

21:17.843 --> 21:18.886
Um...

21:21.555 --> 21:25.059
Proof that... Yamada's a grownup!

21:28.562 --> 21:29.538
You can do it!

21:29.730 --> 21:32.983
(\"I Have Started to Grow Up\")
Do it. Do it, Kyotaro!
